Ablations and Efficiency
We characterize AgentProv’s behavior as a func-
tion of the two budget parameters: the number of
templates K and the number of samples per tem-
plate N. Table 5 reports a joint K × N sweep on
the 630 checkpoint pairs of the 36-model set.
