A.8
Additional Robustness Experiments
Quantization.
We compare full-precision refer-
ences with quantized deployments of Qwen2.5-7B
and Llama-3.1-8B served through vLLM. Table 14
shows that all three methods accept both 8-bit de-
ployments. At 4 bits, AgentProv accepts Qwen2.5-
7B but rejects Llama-3.1-8B, while MET and RUT
reject both. The 4-bit outcome is therefore mixed
and model-dependent rather than uniformly invari-
ant.
